.TH octosnap-pin 1  OctoSnap 
.SH NAME
octosnap\-pin \- Pin an image to the screen
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBoctosnap pin\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPATH\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Pin an image to the screen
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPATH\fR>
The image file, or `\-` to read one from standard input
